.\" pomermaid.1 - the manual page of pomermaid.
.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 22, 2026
.Dt POMERMAID 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pomermaid
.Nd draw Mermaid diagrams in pic, MetaPost and SVG
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl t Ar format
.Op Fl o Ar file
.Op Fl -font Ar font
.Op Fl -size Ar points
.Op Fl -width Ar length
.Op Fl -font-path Ar dirs
.Op Fl -mp-macros Cm inline | input
.Op Fl -svg-text Cm text | outline
.Op Fl -svg-engine Cm mutool | pdftocairo
.Op Ar file
.Nm
.Fl h | v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads one Mermaid diagram from
.Ar file ,
or from the standard input when no
.Ar file
is given, and draws it in pic, for groff's ms and mom documents, in
MetaPost, for ConTeXt, or as SVG, for HTML.
It reads flowcharts,
.Ql flowchart
and
.Ql graph ,
state diagrams,
.Ql stateDiagram-v2
and
.Ql stateDiagram ,
class diagrams,
.Ql classDiagram
and
.Ql classDiagram-v2 ,
entity relationship diagrams,
.Ql erDiagram ,
requirement diagrams,
.Ql requirementDiagram ,
sequence diagrams,
.Ql sequenceDiagram ,
user journeys,
.Ql journey ,
and timelines,
.Ql timeline .
.Pp
The labels are set in the document's own fonts.
For pic and SVG they are measured with groff's font description files;
for MetaPost, ConTeXt measures them and MetaPost places the nodes to
fit them.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl t Ar format , Fl -to Ar format
The output format:
.Bl -tag -width "svg-ms"
.It Cm pic
the diagram's colours as
.Ql .defcolor
requests, then a
.Ql .PS
\&...
.Ql .PE
block (the default);
.It Cm mp
a
.Ql \estartMPcode
\&...
.Ql \estopMPcode
block of MetaFun;
.It Cm svg
an SVG document, made by groff from the pic drawing as a PDF and
turned into SVG by
.Xr mutool 1
or
.Xr pdftocairo 1 ;
.It Cm svg-ms
the groff document the SVG is made from.
.El
.Pp
.Cm dump
and
.Cm layout
write the diagram as read and as laid out, for the tests.
.It Fl o Ar file , Fl -output Ar file
Write to
.Ar file
rather than the standard output.
.It Fl -font Ar font
Set the labels in this groff font:
.Cm TR
by default.
.It Fl -size Ar points
Set the labels at this size, in points: 10 by default.
.It Fl -width Ar length
Make the diagram no wider than
.Ar length ,
in inches, or with the unit
.Cm i ,
.Cm c
or
.Cm p :
.Cm 6i
by default;
.Cm 0
for no limit.
With pic and SVG a wider diagram is laid out again at a smaller size;
with MetaPost it is scaled down.
.It Fl -font-path Ar dirs
Look for groff's fonts in these directories, separated by colons, each
holding
.Pa devpdf
or
.Pa devps .
For SVG they are also passed to groff as
.Fl F .
.It Fl -mp-macros Cm inline | input
For
.Cm mp :
copy the MetaPost macros into the drawing
.Pq Cm inline ,
the default, or write
.Ql input pomermaid ;
.Pq Cm input
for a document that finds the installed
.Pa pomermaid.mp ,
or
.Ql input pomermaid-seq ;
and
.Pa pomermaid-seq.mp
for a sequence diagram.
.It Fl -svg-text Cm text | outline
For
.Cm svg :
keep the labels as text, the default, or draw their glyphs as
outlines.
.Xr pdftocairo 1
always draws outlines.
.It Fl -svg-engine Cm mutool | pdftocairo
For
.Cm svg :
the program that turns groff's PDF into SVG.
By default
.Xr mutool 1
if it is found, else
.Xr pdftocairo 1 .
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Show the version.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show the options.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev GROFF_FONT_PATH
Where to look for groff's fonts when
.Fl -font-path
is not given.
After it,
.Nm
looks in the
.Pa site-font
and
.Pa current/font
directories of the groff found in
.Ev PATH ,
then under
.Pa /usr/local ,
.Pa /usr/pkg
and
.Pa /usr ,
then in
.Pa /usr/share/groff_font ,
.Nx Ap s own groff's, and
.Pa /usr/lib/font .
.It Ev TMPDIR
Where
.Cm svg
makes its temporary directory, which it removes when it is done.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa share/pomermaid/pomermaid.mp
The MetaPost macros, under the installation prefix, for
.Fl -mp-macros Ns = Ns Cm input .
.It Pa share/doc/pomermaid/pomermaid.lua
A pandoc Lua filter that runs
.Nm
on each fenced
.Ql mermaid
code block.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
success
.It 1
a file that cannot be read or written
.It 2
an unknown option
.It 6
a bad option value, or more than one
.Ar file
.It 22
an unknown output format
.It 43
groff,
.Xr mutool 1
or
.Xr pdftocairo 1
failed
.It 47
groff,
.Xr mutool 1
or
.Xr pdftocairo 1
was not found
.It 64
a diagram
.Nm
cannot read; the message gives its line and column
.It 97
the font was not found
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Draw a diagram in an ms document, read with
.Ql .so diagram.pic :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pomermaid -t pic diagram.mmd > diagram.pic
groff -s -ms -p -Tpdf doc.ms > doc.pdf
.Ed
.Pp
The same in a mom document:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pdfmom -s -p doc.mom > doc.pdf
.Ed
.Pp
Draw it for ConTeXt, read with
.Ql \einput diagram :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pomermaid -t mp diagram.mmd > diagram.tex
.Ed
.Pp
Make SVG for a web page:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pomermaid -t svg -o diagram.svg diagram.mmd
.Ed
.Pp
Draw every
.Ql mermaid
block of a markdown document with pandoc:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pandoc --lua-filter pomermaid.lua -s -t html doc.md -o doc.html
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr groff 1 ,
.Xr mutool 1 ,
.Xr pdfmom 1 ,
.Xr pdftocairo 1 ,
.Xr pic 1 ,
.Xr groff_mom 7 ,
.Xr groff_ms 7
.Pp
.Pa share/doc/pomermaid/pomermaid.md
and
.Pa differences.md ,
the full documentation, and where
.Nm
draws differently from Mermaid.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An T. Kurt Bond
.Sh BUGS
Only flowcharts, state diagrams, class diagrams, entity relationship
diagrams, requirement diagrams, sequence diagrams, user journeys and
timelines are read.
Links and tooltips are drawn only in SVG.
Mermaid's named themes, icons, images and animations are not drawn.
